 "This card does not promise a stranger falling from the sky. It describes recognition: a connection that feels familiar quickly, a conversation that flows without effort, a sense of peace rather than anxiety. Many women receive this card when someone already in their outer circle is about to come closer.",
 "<b>Signs to notice:</b> repeated encounters with the same person, a name you keep hearing, a feeling of calm in their presence, conversations that continue naturally the next day.",
 "<b>In shadow:</b> confusing intensity with destiny. True connection rarely needs drama to prove itself.",
 "<b>Your task:</b> keep the Recognition Journal on the reflection pages and write every sign for 21 days.",
