chapter("CHAPTER IV","The Cord-Cutting Ritual","Releasing the bonds that still drain your heart")
P("<b>When:</b> on a waning moon or any Saturday night. <b>Time:</b> 10 minutes. <b>You need:</b> a white candle, a piece of string or thread, a sheet of paper, a pen and a safe heat-proof bowl.")
B(["Light the candle and take three slow breaths.","Write the person's name (or the situation) on the paper, and below it, everything you no longer want to carry from that story.","Tie the string loosely around your left wrist. This represents the bond.","Say: <i>\u201cI thank you for what you taught me. I release you with love. What is mine returns to me; what is yours returns to you.\u201d</i>","Cut or untie the string and place it on the paper.","Fold the paper away from you and, safely, burn it in the bowl — or simply tear it and throw it away outside your home.","Wash your hands with cold water. The ritual is complete."])
box("After the ritual",["For the next seven days, avoid checking the person's profile or reopening old messages. You may feel lighter, or briefly emotional — both are normal signs of release."])
