box("Night Two · Declaring",["Write a letter to the love you are calling in. Describe how you feel with them, not how they look. Use the present tense: <i>\u201cWith you I feel safe, chosen and free.\u201d</i> Fold the letter and keep it under your pillow."])
box("Night Three · Sealing",["Re-read your letter by candlelight. Place a drop of your scent on the paper and say: <i>\u201cI am open. I am ready. I recognise love when it comes.\u201d</i> Keep the letter in a private place for one full moon cycle."])
